5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. Since this is our first day, let's start by getting to know each other. I hope we can find the werewolf while remaining kind to one another.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! This is like a real detective game! I'll use my super-brain to find the wolf and save everyone!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, me too! I wonder who the wolf is? Maybe they're pretending to be super shy right now! Let's have lots of fun!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's not get carried away. Logic and observation are the only things that matter here. I'll be watching for any slips in your stories.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A very pragmatic approach, Shion. I shall happily observe the dance of deception with you. Let us see who maintains their composure the longest.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"It's wonderful to see such energy from Rin and Sakura. However, I agree with Shion and Benjamin that we must be observant. Does anyone have a specific strategy?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"My strategy is to be super honest! If we all tell the truth, the wolf will be the only one lying, and then—BAM! Caught!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm going to look for people who are acting too perfect! Sometimes the wolf tries too hard to be a good person, right? Hehe!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, honesty is a tool the wolf uses to blend in. @Sakura, ""perfection"" is subjective. We should focus on contradictions in statements.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. The most elegant lies are often those that mirror the truth. I shall be looking for the gaps between your words and your intentions.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,You all make very valid points. It's a delicate balance between trust and suspicion. I'll do my best to help us reach a harmonious conclusion.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're so serious! You sound like a teacher! But I'll try to look for contradictions too, just for you!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I wonder if the Seer is already thinking about who to check tonight? I hope they find something super spooky!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,The Seer's identity must remain a secret for as long as possible. Revealing themselves too early is a tactical error.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. A Seer who speaks too soon is merely offering the wolf a convenient target for the night's hunger.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,I think we've established a good foundation for our discussion. Let's end the day here and wait for the first night to pass.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf in a big net! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Sweet dreams! I hope the Seer finds a big clue! See you all tomorrow! Hehe!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,Good night. I will be reflecting on today's interactions.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A peaceful night to you all. I shall retire to my thoughts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
