32,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. I hope everyone slept well. Since the first night has passed, does anyone have any information or suspicions they'd like to share?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! I'm ready! Did the Seer find anything? Please tell us if you found the wolf! I can't wait!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Morning! I had a dream that I was a detective! @Midori, you're so calm, do you think the wolf is someone who talks a lot?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, stop pressuring the Seer. It's illogical. We should wait for a claim or look for behavioral shifts from yesterday.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Shion is correct. However, the silence of a Seer can be just as telling as their voice. I wonder if the result was... surprising?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I believe it's important to be careful. If I were to speak too soon, I might put myself in danger. But we must eventually make a decision.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, you sounded almost like you're the Seer! Are you? If you are, please help us! I want to be a hero!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, is Midori the Seer? That would be so cool! But maybe she's just being nice! Hehe!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, your phrasing was ambiguous. If you are the Seer and have found the wolf, the village's survival depends on your guidance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating tension. Midori's kindness is her shield, but is it also a mask? I find the current atmosphere quite intriguing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I cannot reveal my role so openly, but I can say that I have a very strong suspicion about one of us. I believe Sakura might be the werewolf.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"WHAT?! Sakura?! But she's so cheerful! Are you sure, Midori? This is a huge twist!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! Me?! That's not fair! I'm just a little girl! Midori, why would you say that? I'm just playing a game!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"A direct accusation from someone acting as the Seer. If Midori is the Seer, Sakura is the wolf. If Midori is the wolf, she's framing Sakura.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,A bold move. To accuse the most innocent-seeming member is either a stroke of genius or a desperate lie.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Midori,,I am telling the truth for the sake of the village. I believe we should trust this information to protect ourselves.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't want to vote for Sakura, but if Midori is the Seer, we have to! This is so hard!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm not the wolf! I promise! Please don't vote for me! I'll be super good!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,The probability favors Midori's claim given her consistent demeanor. I will follow the evidence.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic dictates that we test this hypothesis. I shall cast my vote accordingly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
